📗
  🧮 Bounds-checked reads of bytes, UTF-8 validation and ASCII classes.
  Nothing in this class can panic, whatever it is given.
📗
🐇 🧮 🍇
  📗 The byte at *index* as 0 to 255, or -1 when *index* is outside *data*. 📗
  🐇❗️ 💧 data 📇 index 🔢 ➡️ 🔢 🍇
    ↪️ index ◀️ 0 👐 index ▶️🙌 📏 data❓ 🍇
      ↩️ -1
    🍉
    ↩️ 🔢 🐽 data index❗️❗️ ⭕ 0xFF
  🍉

  📗
    The *length* bytes of *data* that start at *from*, clamped to what exists.
    An out-of-range request gives fewer bytes, or none.
  📗
  🐇❗️ 🔪 data 📇 from 🔢 length 🔢 ➡️ 📇 🍇
    📏 data❓ ➡️ size
    from ➡️ 🖍🆕start
    ↪️ start ◀️ 0 🍇
      0 ➡️ 🖍start
    🍉
    ↪️ start ▶️ size 🍇
      size ➡️ 🖍start
    🍉
    length ➡️ 🖍🆕take
    ↪️ take ◀️ 0 🍇
      0 ➡️ 🖍take
    🍉
    ↪️ take ▶️ 🤜size ➖ start🤛 🍇
      size ➖ start ➡️ 🖍take
    🍉
    ↩️ 🔪 data start take❗️
  🍉

  📗 Index of the first *needle* at or after *from*, or -1. An empty needle is never found. 📗
  🐇❗️ 🔍 data 📇 needle 📇 from 🔢 ➡️ 🔢 🍇
    ↪️ 📏 needle❓ 🙌 0 👐 from ◀️ 0 👐 from ▶️🙌 📏 data❓ 🍇
      ↩️ -1
    🍉
    ↪️ 🔍 data needle from❗️ ➡️ index 🍇
      ↩️ index
    🍉
    ↩️ -1
  🍉

